Put the image archives for a new cluster in this directory before playbook 02-prepare-ceph.

Accepted formats: *.tar.gz and *.tar.zst (podman load -i).

The first host in [mons] copies every matching archive here to
/var/lib/containers/registry-images, loads archives that are not already
loaded, and publishes images that are not already present in the local registry.

registry.tar.gz (or registry.tar.zst) has to be in the directory. It is the
registry image and is not pushed. Typical companions are the ceph, grafana,
haproxy, node-exporter, and victoriametrics archives.
